<title>SPAIN: Spain confirms electric tariff cut of 3 pct in 97.</title>
<headline>Spain confirms electric tariff cut of 3 pct in 97.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain confirmed it would cut electric utility rates by three percent in 1997, Industry Minister Josep Pique told journalists on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The rates will be lowered by three percent in 1997,&quot; Pique said.</p>
<p>The largest cut would affect small and medium businesses and household consumers, while large businesses would face an unchanged rate, he said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
